{
  "id": "760",
  "title": "To Have a Lie-In",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-02-08",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming doesn’t want to get out of bed on a Sunday morning.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/760/28ecc9800f39a69609aaf71fe36d7e28eea5df7f.mp3?1580462414",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "赖床\n\n妈妈：你怎么还赖在床上看手机？都11点了，快起床！\n小明：妈妈，我每天上学真的很累。今天是星期天，你就让我再睡一会儿吧。\n妈妈：你这哪是睡觉？8点就醒了，一直在床上玩手机到现在。你这是赖床。\n小明：那你就让我再赖一会儿吧！\n妈妈：懒虫！别赖床了！快起来！",
    "traditional": "賴床\n\n媽媽：你怎麼還賴在床上看手機？都11點了，快起床！\n小明：媽媽，我每天上學真的很累。今天是星期天，你就讓我再睡一會兒吧。\n媽媽：你這哪是睡覺？8點就醒了，一直在床上玩手機到現在。你這是賴床。\n小明：那你就讓我再賴一會兒吧！\n媽媽：懶蟲！別賴床了！快起來！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "To Have a Lie-In"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你怎么还赖在床上看手机？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你怎麼還賴在床上看手機？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ zěn me hái lài zài chuáng shang kàn shǒu jī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "都11点了，快起床！",
      "traditional": "都11點了，快起床！",
      "pinyin": "dōu 2 diǎn le kuài qǐ chuáng",
      "english": "Mom: Why are you still hanging around in bed looking at your phone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s 11 o’clock, hurry and get out of bed!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，我每天上学真的很累。",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我每天上學真的很累。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ měi tiān shàng xué zhēn de hěn lèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "今天是星期天，你就让我再睡一会儿吧。",
      "traditional": "今天是星期天，你就讓我再睡一會兒吧。",
      "pinyin": "jīn tiān shì xīng qī tiān nǐ jiù ràng wǒ zài shuì yí huì'r ba",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, I really am very tired from going to school every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s Sunday today, so would you let me sleep a little while more, OK?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你这哪是睡觉？",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你這哪是睡覺？",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ zhè nǎ shì shuì jiào",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "8点就醒了，一直在床上玩手机到现在。",
      "traditional": "8點就醒了，一直在床上玩手機到現在。",
      "pinyin": "1 diǎn jiù xǐng le yì zhí zài chuáng shang wán shǒu jī dào xiàn zài",
      "english": "Mom: In what way is this sleeping?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "你这是赖床。",
      "traditional": "你這是賴床。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ zhè shì lài chuáng",
      "english": "You woke up at 8 o’clock, and you’ve been in bed playing on your phone all along until now."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "It’s a lie-in you’re having."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小明：那你就让我再赖一会儿吧！",
      "traditional": "小明：那你就讓我再賴一會兒吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng nà nǐ jiù ràng wǒ zài lài yí huì'r ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Then just let me lie-in a little while more!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "妈妈：懒虫！别赖床了！快起来！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：懶蟲！別賴床了！快起來！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma lǎn chóng bié lài chuáng le kuài qǐ lai",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Lazy slob! Don’t dawdle in bed! Hurry out of bed!"
    }
  ],
